                                                "sense_id": "d2716b37-7ab9-37b1-bc80-9e384ee6b295",
                                                "text": "For diarrhea caused by a stomach virus or a meal that didn’t agree with you, try the BRAT diet, says James Lee, MD, gastroenterologist with St. Joseph Hospital in Orange, Calif."
                                            },
                                            {
